(problem-output)
*title Problem-level output integration
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 first start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=10 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *when time=2 stop
*trajectory 2 second start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=100 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=5 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *when time=2 stop
*define del_y
  del_y = yecfc[2] - yecfc[1];
*file compare.dat
  time[1] yecfc[1] yecfc[2] del_y
*print del_y
*egs trajectories.dbf
  time yecfc vel
*end
